{"page": 154, "lines": [{"t": "DSP—2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 262.0, "y": 141.0}, {"t": "SATELLITE OPERATION", "x": 1492.0, "y": 147.0}, {"t": "11.6. 3", "x": 263.0, "y": 220.0}, {"t": "7/92", "x": 242.0, "y": 2554.0}, {"t": "Satellite Proqrams", "x": 471.0, "y": 222.0}, {"t": "To send and receive files on the PACSATs, you may wind up using the", "x": 470.0, "y": 303.0}, {"t": "PB and PG programs available from AMSAT. These require gome", "x": 471.0, "y": 343.0}, {"t": "special parameter settings in the DSP—2232 which are listed below.", "x": 470.0, "y": 381.0}, {"t": "The following configuration files have been used successfully with", "x": 469.0, "y": 421.0}, {"t": "the PB and PG programs. Thanks to Bob McGwier ( N4HY) for the f i leg.", "x": 469.0, "y": 462.0}, {"t": "; PB configuration file example (PB. CFG)", "x": 573.0, "y": 542.0}, {"t": "Corments start with ; and are ignored.", "x": 608.0, "y": 583.0}, {"t": "; Remove and add", "x": 572.0, "y": 622.0}, {"t": "as appropriate to your setup.", "x": 949.0, "y": 623.0}, {"t": "; Set. your .callsign", "x": 571.0, "y": 662.0}, {"t": "mycall N4HY", "x": 566.0, "y": 700.0}, {"t": "; Set the satellite's callsign", "x": 570.0, "y": 741.0}, {"t": "bdcstcall uosat5—11", "x": 566.0, "y": 781.0}, {"t": "; Set a directory for the pb operations if you want to", "x": 570.0, "y": 821.0}, {"t": "; this is where all files will be stored", "x": 569.0, "y": 861.0}, {"t": "; pbpath C:", "x": 569.0, "y": 902.0}, {"t": "; And any other callsign or string that you are known by", "x": 569.0, "y": 942.0}, {"t": "; myaddr ALL", "x": 568.0, "y": 982.0}, {"t": "; COM Port and TNC settings", "x": 568.0, "y": 1023.0}, {"t": "; port 1", "x": 568.0, "y": 1063.0}, {"t": "port 2", "x": 563.0, "y": 1103.0}, {"t": "speed 19200", "x": 564.0, "y": 1142.0}, {"t": "restart delay 60", "x": 563.0, "y": 1182.0}, {"t": "txd 120", "x": 562.0, "y": 1222.0}, {"t": "Please use graball so the satellite is more useful for everyone", "x": 602.0, "y": 1263.0}, {"t": "graball 1", "x": 561.0, "y": 1303.0}, {"t": "; Up to 10 block f type entries keep PB from saving the file types", "x": 565.0, "y": 1342.0}, {"t": "that you specify. e.g. blockftype 2 gets rid of BBS forwarding", "x": 601.0, "y": 1382.0}, {"t": "traffic.", "x": 601.0, "y": 1423.0}, {"t": "blockftype 2", "x": 560.0, "y": 1464.0}, {"t": "These entries control frame logging", "x": 600.0, "y": 1504.0}, {"t": "directory broadcast frames", "x": 599.0, "y": 1544.0}, {"t": "; Iogdbframes 1", "x": 563.0, "y": 1585.0}, {"t": "message broadcast frames", "x": 598.0, "y": 1625.0}, {"t": "; logpbframes 1", "x": 562.0, "y": 1665.0}, {"t": "all other frames", "x": 599.0, "y": 1706.0}, {"t": "; logothers 1", "x": 562.0, "y": 1746.0}, {"t": "How long to keep . act and . hol files", "x": 597.0, "y": 1787.0}, {"t": "actdays 3", "x": 557.0, "y": 1827.0}, {"t": "How many bytes of pfhdir. pfh is max", "x": 596.0, "y": 1868.0}, {"t": "maxpfhdirsize 250000", "x": 555.0, "y": 1909.0}, {"t": "• How many bytes of pfhdir . pfh to leave after archiving", "x": 561.0, "y": 1948.0}, {"t": "minpfhdirsize 25000", "x": 554.0, "y": 1989.0}, {"t": "How many minutes of no packets to exit after", "x": 595.0, "y": 2031.0}, {"t": "; exitafter O", "x": 559.0, "y": 2071.0}, {"t": "Turn off all automatic downloading THIS WAS O", "x": 595.0, "y": 2111.0}, {"t": "automode 1", "x": 555.0, "y": 2152.0}, {"t": "• Turn on batch file builder", "x": 560.0, "y": 2192.0}, {"t": "; makebat 1", "x": 558.0, "y": 2232.0}, {"t": "Bats 1 and Bats 2 allow you to customize what ends . up in", "x": 595.0, "y": 2271.0}, {"t": "the batch file postpass. bat", "x": 594.0, "y": 2313.0}, {"t": "bats 1 •call my proct", "x": 594.0, "y": 2354.0}, {"t": "bats2 ' . dl'", "x": 594.0, "y": 2395.0}, {"t": "ndupesearch 200", "x": 554.0, "y": 2436.0}, {"t": "select pb. eqn", "x": 554.0, "y": 2476.0}, {"t": "11-6", "x": 1066.0, "y": 2558.0}]}